<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JCI Q1 pre-capex net slides to 44 mln rand.</title>
<headline>JCI Q1 pre-capex net slides to 44 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit before capital spending  44.24	vs 132.89</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			     2,671,000  vs 2,754,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			  10,676     vs 11,724</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    4.00	 vs 4.26</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			    50,654     vs 47,726</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)			 52,819     vs 56,096</p>
<p>Full name: JCI Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Aggregate results for JCI Ltd's three gold mines, Randfontein Estates Gold Mining Co, Western Areas Gold Mining Company Ltd and HJ Joel Gold Mining Co Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
